  "description": "Explore more, worry less\nBuilt for riders who see a bike ride as an invitation to explore, Whyte Secta-E makes it easier to leave the familiar behind and see what's around the next corner.\nIts powerful Avinox M2 drive system and high-capacity 800Wh battery help make longer rides and bigger days out feel effortlessly achievable. Add 130mm of front suspension, large 29in wheels and our confidence-inspiring handling, and you've got an electric mountain bike that's equally at home on everyday roads, quiet country lanes and forest trails.\nConfident, capable and easy to enjoy, Whyte Secta-E is ready when curiosity takes over.\nIdeal for: Exploring, weekend adventures, everyday rides and taking the interesting way home.",
